diff --git a/tools/overview-viewer/CLAUDE.md b/tools/overview-viewer/CLAUDE.md
index 54d4301c9eaf6fc8936e02f31c721765648979d7..d801511445750591922f169ddd3c56a4bf8f7e13
--- a/tools/overview-viewer/CLAUDE.md
